Package: kite-desktop
Version: 1.4.3
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KiteOS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: xfce4-session, xfwm4, xfce4-panel, xfdesktop4, xfce4-settings, xfconf, thunar, xfce4-terminal,
 xfce4-power-manager, xfce4-power-manager-plugins, xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin, kite-docklike,
 xfce4-notifyd, xfce4-screensaver, exo-utils, xfce4-appfinder, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter, accountsservice, orchis-gtk-theme,
 papirus-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, x11-xserver-utils, x11-utils, procps, pkexec, python3, libspa-0.2-bluetooth, libxcb-shape0,
 gnome-keyring, libpam-gnome-keyring, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-wnck-3.0, picom, kite-system
Recommends: fonts-roboto | fonts-dejavu-core, brave-browser, onlyoffice-desktopeditors
Description: KiteOS desktop
 XFCE in a Windows-style layout set up by kite-layout: Fluent theme,
 Papirus-Light icons, a taskbar with the Start menu, search and apps on the
 left. The Search key opens the menu. Short window and menu animations with
 picom (xfwm4's compositor when picom cannot run). Wallpapers, the LightDM login screen and
 lock screen (one look, set in Settings > Login Screen), KiteOS Task Manager
 and artwork.
